* FST3253 dual 4:1 bus switch, behavioural, from the onsemi 74FST3253 datasheet:
* switches are NMOS (level 1) fitted to the three datasheet RON points within ~15 %: 4 ohm at
* VIN = 0 V / 64 mA / VCC 4.5 V, 8 ohm typ (15 max) at VIN = 2.4 V / 15 mA / VCC 4.5 V and 11 typ
* (20 max) at VIN = 2.4 V / VCC 4.0 V (vto 0.3 V, kp*W/L = 59.5 mA/V^2, no body effect), so RON
* rises as the signal nears VCC (13 ohm at the 2.5 V bias with VCC 5 V);
* A port 13 pF, B ports 5 pF; select inputs TTL (threshold 1.5 V); /OE active low. The
* 2-to-4 decoder is ideal fast switches (select-to-bus delay, 1-5.3 ns, is not modelled: only
* its mismatch matters, and that is applied as LO skew). VCC must be 4.0-5.5 V.
* Truth table (S1 S0): 00 -> B0, 01 -> B1, 10 -> B2, 11 -> B3.
* Nodes follow the SOIC-16/TSSOP-16 pinout:
*  1 /1OE  2 S1  3 1B3  4 1B2  5 1B1  6 1B0  7 1A  8 GND  9 2A 10 2B0 11 2B1 12 2B2 13 2B3 14 S0 15 /2OE 16 VCC
.model FST_NSW nmos(level=1 vto=0.3 kp=59.5m gamma=0 lambda=0)
.model FST_HI sw(vt=1.5 vh=0.05 ron=10 roff=1e9)
.model FST_LO sw(vt=-1.5 vh=0.05 ron=10 roff=1e9)
* S model control voltage = v(nc+) - v(nc-); FST_LO with nodes (gnd, x) is on when v(x) < 1.5 V
.subckt FST3253 oe1 s1 b13 b12 b11 b10 a1 gnd a2 b20 b21 b22 b23 s0 oe2 vcc
* gate k is pulled to VCC when /1OE is low and (S1, S0) selects it, else pulled to GND
Sen vcc en gnd oe1 FST_LO
* selector for each gate: series pull-up through the two select conditions,
* parallel pull-down when either condition fails or the section is disabled
Su0a en u0 gnd s1 FST_LO
Su0b u0 g0 gnd s0 FST_LO
Sd0a g0 gnd s1 gnd FST_HI
Sd0b g0 gnd s0 gnd FST_HI
Sd0c g0 gnd oe1 gnd FST_HI
Su1a en u1 gnd s1 FST_LO
Su1b u1 g1 s0 gnd FST_HI
Sd1a g1 gnd s1 gnd FST_HI
Sd1b g1 gnd gnd s0 FST_LO
Sd1c g1 gnd oe1 gnd FST_HI
Su2a en u2 s1 gnd FST_HI
Su2b u2 g2 gnd s0 FST_LO
Sd2a g2 gnd gnd s1 FST_LO
Sd2b g2 gnd s0 gnd FST_HI
Sd2c g2 gnd oe1 gnd FST_HI
Su3a en u3 s1 gnd FST_HI
Su3b u3 g3 s0 gnd FST_HI
Sd3a g3 gnd gnd s1 FST_LO
Sd3b g3 gnd gnd s0 FST_LO
Sd3c g3 gnd oe1 gnd FST_HI
Cg0 g0 gnd 0.5p
Cg1 g1 gnd 0.5p
Cg2 g2 gnd 0.5p
Cg3 g3 gnd 0.5p
Ru0 u0 gnd 1e9
Ru1 u1 gnd 1e9
Ru2 u2 gnd 1e9
Ru3 u3 gnd 1e9
Ren en gnd 1e9
M0 a1 g0 b10 gnd FST_NSW w=1 l=1
M1 a1 g1 b11 gnd FST_NSW w=1 l=1
M2 a1 g2 b12 gnd FST_NSW w=1 l=1
M3 a1 g3 b13 gnd FST_NSW w=1 l=1
Ca1 a1 gnd 13p
Cb10 b10 gnd 5p
Cb11 b11 gnd 5p
Cb12 b12 gnd 5p
Cb13 b13 gnd 5p
* section 2 is unused on this board (/2OE high): only its port capacitances remain
* (with 1 Gohm leakage so its open ports have a DC path)
Rla2 a2 gnd 1e9
Rlb20 b20 gnd 1e9
Rlb21 b21 gnd 1e9
Rlb22 b22 gnd 1e9
Rlb23 b23 gnd 1e9
Ca2 a2 gnd 13p
Cb20 b20 gnd 5p
Cb21 b21 gnd 5p
Cb22 b22 gnd 5p
Cb23 b23 gnd 5p
Roe2 oe2 gnd 1e9
.ends FST3253
